{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（18日）早上9時24分，屯門友愛路發生交通意外。據報一名男子持刀搶軚阻止一輛私家車開行，最終私家車撞欄，持刀男飛墮地上受傷。網上流傳一段</p><p>警方到場後在涉事私家車上檢獲逾200枚懷疑是依托米脂的煙彈，並在路邊花槽檢獲一把牛肉刀。捱私家車撞的29歲姓葉男子左腳流血受傷，被送往醫院治理。案件暫列販毒及藏有攻擊性武器，暫時未有人被捕。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133023178281455616309128.jpeg/A0oY-_NpiT990WWB8FYKr7eJI9pTbc60FlJbMhZSWzI\" alt=\"男子半身俯入車廂搶軚。（車CAM截圖）\"><figcaption>男子半身俯入車廂搶軚。（車CAM截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133023180550705152924615.jpeg/QpzF_QlnGU-Uv9dk0M8z6UO9pmvRpQVeUpziPVKc4j0\" alt=\"男子半身俯入車廂搶軚。（車CAM截圖）\"><figcaption>男子半身俯入車廂搶軚。（車CAM截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133023182635405312870519.jpeg/IY1e_oA1uHbor_A-XN_CTU1GQa5dRkpRt-B3e7fgd3s\" alt=\"兩名男子先後走往現場視察。（車CAM截圖）\"><figcaption>兩名男子先後走往現場視察。（車CAM截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133023184585887744972365.jpeg/aiwirvlIq1D59ZV8mOx6e4cFxY5VRvljXvgOLF74Diw\" alt=\"兩名男子先後走往現場視察。（車CAM截圖）\"><figcaption>兩名男子先後走往現場視察。（車CAM截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133030916965273600721963.jpeg/OoCDHzGoLjHtiOPghuHSRa_TWBC-1VCzZuL6e2bi-ns\" alt=\"救護員在場替傷者急救。（Facebook「屯門友」圖片）\"><figcaption>救護員在場替傷者急救。（Facebook「屯門友」圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133004357579575296519674.jpeg/ay0l55XWDtDX8K_tUlaRj1DfsEhZWyq6GDbwljI28JY\" alt=\"私家車剷上花槽，車頭凹陷。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>私家車剷上花槽，車頭凹陷。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><p>有目擊者稱，事發前涉事私家車停在友愛邨愛德樓對開彎位，兩名男子與車上司機糾纏。私家車開行時，當中一人捉住軚盤，另一人從後追上，行駛約150米後司機扭右剷上花槽撞欄杆，該名搶軚的男子倒在約3米外地上受傷，手上的牛肉刀飛到附近花槽。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133015023455571968382576.jpeg/v71f_VbWplEH_vfUo1HR16V_j8ut7fD15N6_f87ev38\" alt=\"警方在路邊花槽檢獲牛肉刀。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>警方在路邊花槽檢獲牛肉刀。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><p>至於追私家車的男子，與及私家車司機，在事件後分別逃去無蹤。警方在車上檢獲逾200枚懷疑是依托米脂的煙彈，花槽有一把牛肉刀。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133005895622463488958472.jpeg/RM94zOmBXNG8UL7TebTDx9iP0CYQSrbMBA71MC4O9TA\" alt=\"私家車剷上花槽，車頭凹陷；警方拉起封鎖線。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>私家車剷上花槽，車頭凹陷；警方拉起封鎖線。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133006055312199680162407.jpeg/UNn3NELmAO9xBw1Yz98w3mu1EmVvLjlCSaI5gmOiOYI\" alt=\"私家車剷上花槽，車頭凹陷，安全氣袋亦彈出。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>私家車剷上花槽，車頭凹陷，安全氣袋亦彈出。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133009428203704320901623.jpeg/OgXAe30cYHqdXQzZRobvzPbqu5_Yjet0fj684lQ-vOI\" alt=\"車上有逾200枚煙彈。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>車上有逾200枚煙彈。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133013808420229120513720.jpeg/1bP4a6pM-aRLdPUmPakccA7ait1M50dQqLX2JIK19iQ\" alt=\"目擊者稱，私家車停在友愛路彎位時，兩名男子與司機糾纏。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>目擊者稱，私家車停在友愛路彎位時，兩名男子與司機糾纏。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133014671192756224351248.jpeg/C2ugbxnMsyO6LMV6U5u50-oNFlytlnSQvSgq7JcoKuw\" alt=\"警方刑事調查隊人員到場，檢視花槽的牛肉刀。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>警方刑事調查隊人員到場，檢視花槽的牛肉刀。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132999689382662144724369.jpeg/hGfKIlTdtW0rI_00n0TyeEZKZN_ofKSMFlHpCRZR6Qk\" alt=\"救護員替傷者急救。（網上截圖）\"><figcaption>救護員替傷者急救。（網上截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132999687247630336350421.jpeg/7huzIZAFYA9EXgMupkhCQlhkR59aYrO4JMgrnCTIK5w\" alt=\"救護員替傷者急救。（網上截圖）\"><figcaption>救護員替傷者急救。（網上截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132999685188096000801293.jpeg/ZhDR5gNPXZhCpeZEZCvXtYNDkIbzU1BpPBlWbDwZVmw\" alt=\"救護員替傷者急救。（網上截圖）\"><figcaption>救護員替傷者急救。（網上截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132999682893680640642785.jpeg/73AL2J61PfQjITaIEMsCt2R5QVU6ydsFJdATxiXQE8Y\" alt=\"救護員替傷者急救。（網上截圖）\"><figcaption>救護員替傷者急救。（網上截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1132999680406327296645092.jpeg/cesotjJAJhPuR7ME5UIm7DGX5L-uZqY3xj-348Y_t-M\" alt=\"私家車車頭損毀。（網上截圖）\"><figcaption>私家車車頭損毀。（網上截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133004806252662784564219.jpeg/pQZi6d-yYRV6SMhp6lFD8b7KQh1IpQ_bZvwqCmb8Kgo\" alt=\"私家車剷上花槽，安全氣袋彈出。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>私家車剷上花槽，安全氣袋彈出。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133004808677101568174305.jpeg/WzI5p1lNmoJdcE5qVNesl-GUOfOWoKFxV8Zu7FfGbuw\" alt=\"私家車剷上花槽，安全氣袋彈出。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>私家車剷上花槽，安全氣袋彈出。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133004810753413120679015.jpeg/LJMoQqXgZ_CYTyB_A5HWQdpGtPeCGBUTFJX1jRSV9Y0\" alt=\"私家車剷上花槽，司機不顧而去。（蔡正邦攝）\"><figcaption>私家車剷上花槽，司機不顧而去。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-18T05:58:40.739247+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":778,"images":20,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}